        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 3911S, Square Sliding Pocket Door Privacy Lock Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Square Privacy Pocket Door Mortise Lock is great for contemporary homes. It is available in an array of today's most popular finishes, so you will be able to find the one that best compliments your home. This privacy lock is suitable for use on bathroom and bedroom doors that are 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick with at least 1/8 inch clearance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe finger edge pull is screwed into the door's edge so that you have something to grip in order to slide the door out of the pocket. The flush pulls are screwed into the door's face. The mortise lock body is easily mounted with two screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via an emergency turn. A privacy lock does not offer security, it offers privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-square-pocket-door-passage-set-omnia-3911s-p\"><b>Solid Brass Passage Pocket Door Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-square-cup-pull-omnia-7504-52\"><b>Solid Brass Square Flush Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 3911S Square Pocket Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>Solid Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Trim Length: 2-3/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lockbody Length: 3-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lockbody Depth: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Faceplate Length: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Faceplate Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Set:</b> privacy mortise lock body, two (2) square flush pulls, edge pull, strike plate, and all mounting hardware. For One (1) Door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/made-usa-logo.jpg?v=1704354497\" width=\"515\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
